%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: IrinaIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Sorry. I know I look tired. The ward energy has been really heavy this
      week. Irina Kakulia. Student nurse. I cover the elderly care wing, and I look
      after my grandmother at home.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: I moved in with her a few months ago. She's on the fourth floor of the southern block. Mzia, the seamstress. You may have seen her.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Is she doing well?
      npcResponse: "She keeps telling me she\u2019s fine. She says it the same way she talks about her sewing, so I mostly believe her."
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    - playerChoiceText: That must be a lot to balance.
      npcResponse: The universe keeps asking us to carry more than we think we can. I keep being surprised by how much I hold.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "My nursing rotation is four mornings a week; I keep her medication
      schedule on the back of the same form. I keep my documents in her prayer book
      \u2014 she said it was for protection, I didn\u2019t argue. My hands shake a
      little in the mornings. The air quality, I think. Or mercury retrograde."
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: The patients ask me what's happening. I tell them to breathe through it. Which I know sounds like nothing. But it's what I have right now. Papers. I keep them very organized. It's the one thing I can keep organized.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Is that working?
      npcResponse: "For some of them. For me... I\u2019m still deciding."
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    - playerChoiceText: How are you holding up?
      npcResponse: "I\u2019m aligned. Mostly. The frequency in the ward is very strange right now. I\u2019m working on adjusting."
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
